<title>AUSTRALIA: RTRS-Finemore half yr profit rises six pct.</title>
<headline>RTRS-Finemore half yr profit rises six pct.</headline>
<dateline>SYDNEY 1997-02-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to December 31</p>
<p>		 (million A$ unless stated)</p>
<p>    Operating profit		     8.98 vs 8.50</p>
<p>    Net					5.49 vs 5.18</p>
<p>    Dividend (cents)		     5.0  vs 4.0</p>
<p>NOTE: Finemore Holdings Ltd is a trucking company based in Wagga Wagga, New South Wales.</p>
<p>    Sales				  131.74 vs 124.23</p>
<p>    Other income			   2.12 vs 3.49</p>
<p>    Shr</p>
<p>(cents) 14.56 vs 13.79</p>
<p>    Abnormal items			 nil  vs nil</p>
<p>Dividend is 100 percent franked</p>
<p>Pay date March 13</p>
<p>Reg date February 28</p>
<p>    Tax					3.48 vs 3.32</p>
<p>    Interest				 0.11 vs 0.44</p>
<p>    Depreciation			   4.87 vs 4.28</p>
<p>-- Sydney newsroom 61-2 9373-1800</p>
